name: the Help System (Help tab, Get Help): its faq button opens the pop-up browser (UIPopupBrowserClass 0 'RNW' titled Knowledgebase: http://support.net-7.org/, a string in client.exe) and its close box closes it
# _wip_ (not in the default run): rename to browser_*.scn when ui_popup_browser.cpp's PopupBrowserSettingsClass::
# Unknown_7CB240 is the settings store's real Unknown_7CA2D0Class::Unknown_7CB240 (0x7CB240, DestroyBrowser):
# until then each XFAIL leaves the page drawn and would cost the default run a client start.
# ui_petition.cpp's 0x5D38F0 key 2 hides the Help System and makes UIPopupBrowserClass(0, "Knowledgebase") as its page; the
# URL from the settings store's table (settings_store.cpp 0x7C97B0). See browser_credits for the stand-in.
expected-fail: the browser is never destroyed: ui_popup_browser.cpp calls a phantom PopupBrowserSettingsClass::Unknown_7CB240 (a stand-in) instead of the settings store's 0x7CB240
timeout: 400
include _login
stand-in 'PopupBrowserSettingsClass::Unknown_7CB240'
click gadget chat.tab.help
alive 0.5
click gadget help.gethelp
expect-event proxy 'fa_hsi01a\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
click gadget petition.faq
expect-event proxy 'fc_jweb01\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 2.0 within 30
alive 8
shot browser_petition_faq
click gadget browser.close
expect-event proxy 'fc_jweb01\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
# the page closed, the Help System shows itself again (0x5D3F80: Closed 1); its close box closes it
click gadget petition.close
expect-event proxy 'fa_hsi01a\.ini", R, disposition 3\) = ok' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
key 0xC0
expect-event antprox 'received REQUEST_TARGET 0x0017, 8 bytes' within 10
